Files: rust-toolchain-dist/*
Copyright: The Rust Project Developers
License: Apache-2.0 or MIT
Comment:
 Prebuilt Rust toolchain (rustc, cargo, standard library) bundled for
 offline Launchpad builds, because Ubuntu's packaged rustc is below this
 tree's MSRV. Upstream: https://www.rust-lang.org (dual MIT/Apache-2.0).
 The toolchain additionally contains LLVM components licensed under
 Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception; the bundled tree retains upstream license
 texts, and rust-toolchain-dist/BUNDLE-INFO.txt records the exact bundled
 version. See debian/scripts/bundle-rust-toolchain.sh for the pinned version.

